          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawlo, ea Silwano, ea Dimoteo, Heeda ganiiseeda Desalonike mida heeda ASEETA was Bwaabwa ea heeda Ng'utamiida was Yesu Gristo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa anyasa dagheerjeanduumeeda ea hoyyoo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eaweega ea masaweega fuga Desalonike",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geabadiischeesi ASEETA galeagasean aba badahuukeagwa oogasean, nea geapkaacheegwa aba jeeda mooshteanya bea ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ghaapkaacheegwa aba madeeda ASEETEANYA was Ghweanda, gadiyeedeang'wa bea masaweega ea bariinyeegeagwa gadiiyi ea milikghteaydeang'wa bea rarooda aba jeeda Ng'utamiideanya was Yesu Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba geanali, fuga eaduupcheewi bwariiy ASEETA, gideaba niny niloadeagwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bea gideaba giijasteanya miy mwahina heedeang'wa nea geaghus ng'asheanda ak ghwahit, ghabwada gwandeawa uurda, ea Guroorooda Ghaydit nea geesikteawi muuchi. Ak ghoanali siisi siruguun giduurji jea goobiida heedeang'wa, aba badahuukeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoahuuyi fuga adeascheeweasa geat ea geeshta Ng'utamiida, iing'ata nea noang'waanyi ng'asheanda aba sawanadeeda haw, sea hooseaneega Guroorooda Ghaydit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghoahuuyi gichea eegala aba heeda buuneesean mideawa masaweega aba ng'eanyiida Makedoniya, ea ng'eanyiida Akaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea meakghusa gideaba ghwadaambiir ng'asheanda Ng'utamiida aba heedeang'wa aba Makedoniya ea Akaya, iidu masaweegeagwa aba heeda ASEETA ea niiwa mwadi aba darooraka sean, ea eeyi bwak ea ea mudeamuusa eerukuna gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba saawa nea gaba geat gwarukwiida iiteanya gida oadeaptaaydaneasa aba jeedeang'wa, ea gidooyamsiindi geat ASEETA nea ghoanung'waadi sanaamu ak googadiyeesi dea mideawa eaweega ea ASEETA huumwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ghoamuughu orjeedaanyi jea gwaleabu humng'eeda, ghayi aduuna miyeeda, nea Yesu gil, lealnaneasa nyarasta jea ghwahidu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
